## How to read it

PDL removes launch gaps, so any win is largest where the step is short (small L). Bars inside the gray ±{{ ctx.noise_pct }}% band are noise; PDL stays opt-in (`MJOLNIR_ATTN_PDL=1`) unless it wins consistently.

## Reproduce

```bash
mjolnir verify pdl
```

